{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fee32b94-b4c2-8a40-9d6c-766962db43f6",
  "created_at": "2025-12-07T13:21:28-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ivone Semedo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:17:48-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:17:51-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. My name is Ivone Semedo. I understand City Hall is closed today, but I was given this number for storm matters. I would like to inquire about a fallen tree."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:18:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, you've got the right place. Sunday, so the main offices are closed, but this line's up for storm stuff. What happened with the tree?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:18:13-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "After the nor'easter that ended yesterday, a large tree at the edge of my front yard came down. The roots pulled up out of the ground, and the whole root ball is now standing on its side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:18:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, root ball tipped up. Got it. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:18:31-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is 52 Ocean Avenue, on the Ocean Drive side."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:18:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fifty-two Ocean Avenue. And is the tree on your property, or is it out in the street or on the sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:18:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The trunk is lying across my lawn, and some of the upper branches extend over the sidewalk. It is not blocking the road itself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:18:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, so mostly on your side. Any wires involved? Anything hanging on the tree?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:18:58-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There is a utility line running along the street, but I do not believe it is touching the tree. I would not want to go near it to check, however."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:19:09-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good call, don't. If you see anything sagging or sparking, that goes to the electric company right away. I'll note no visible contact for now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:19:18-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. May I ask directly, then: whom should I call about this? Is it the city, myself as the owner, or the utility company that handles it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:19:29-05:00",
      "duration": 24,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, generally, if a tree's on private property, removing it is the owner's responsibility. If it's a city street tree or it's blocking the public way, that's us. And if it's on a wire, that's the utility. Since yours is on your lawn with branches over the sidewalk, I'd say the lawn part is yours, but let me log it so a crew can look at the sidewalk portion."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:19:53-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. So I should hire a private tree service for the trunk and the roots."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:19:59-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Most likely, yeah. And if the sidewalk's blocked, we'd look at clearing enough for people to get by. I'm putting down the address, tree down after the nor'easter, roots lifted, branches over the sidewalk, no road blockage."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:20:13-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is correct. Is there a place where I can report this in the future, other than telephoning this line? I would like to know where to report a downed tree in general."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:20:25-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "On a weekday you can call Public Works during regular hours, or use the city's online request form on the website. This storm line is for after hours and emergencies, which is kind of where you are today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:20:39-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I ask partly because I need to plan my week. The school pickup time for my child keeps changing by ten minutes, and I would like to know when I can arrange the tree service."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:20:52-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, makes sense. I'd call a tree company first thing tomorrow, they're probably swamped after the storm. Want a callback number on this ticket?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:21:01-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, please. It is 401-555-0194."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:21:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-four. Okay. If a crew's going to be by for the sidewalk, they'd just look from the street, so you don't need to be home."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:21:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is helpful. Thank you very much for your time, Mr. Sousa."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:21:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, Ms. Semedo. Stay clear of that root ball, the ground can be soft. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-07T13:21:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Goodbye."
    }
  ],
